{
  "headline": "Your Brain Left the Chat Seven Days Ago",
  "roastReport": "You managed to like 239 videos in seven days, which means your thumb has more mileage than a cross-country trucker. Ninety-two percent of your digital diet is Shorts, proving you have the attention span of a goldfish with a concussion. You spent your late nights between midnight and five in the morning liking 151 different clips of slime and loops. That is not relaxing. That is a distress signal.\n\nYour entire personality is built on titles like satisfying slime loop and fyp or die. You do not even have contradictions to mock because you lack a single redeeming intellectual hobby. You have zero self-improvement videos liked, zero ambition, and 44 doses of pure ragebait just to feel a pulse. You are trapped in an algorithmic loop of your own making.\n\nEven your rare diversions are pathetic. You watched a twenty-five minute video called debunking the biggest lie, likely the longest stretch of uninterrupted thought you managed all week, only to immediately crawl back to shorts culture and factory loops. Drama Daily gave you nineteen likes, which is nineteen too many for someone who already lives in a perpetual state of manufactured outrage.\n\nYour watch later playlist holds thirty videos that will rot into digital dust because you will never watch anything longer than sixty seconds again. You are a passive recipient of garbage. You are human static.",
  "brainrotScore": 70,
  "brainrotTier": "Terminal",
  "redFlags": [
    "Liked 239 videos in the last 7 days.",
    "92 percent of liked content is Shorts.",
    "151 likes hammered out between midnight and 5 AM.",
    "Zero self-improvement videos in the entire history.",
    "Forty-four ragebait videos consumed for empty dopamine."
  ],
  "personality": "A clinical specimen of algorithm dependency with zero original thoughts left. Displays classic symptoms of cognitive atrophy driven exclusively by vertical video loops and manufactured rage.",
  "existentialQuestion": "Will your thumbs outlive your ability to feel joy?",
  "channelRoasts": [
    {
      "channel": "Shorts Gremlin",
      "roast": "Two hundred twenty-one likes for an account that exists purely to fry your receptors with slime and loops."
    },
    {
      "channel": "Drama Daily",
      "roast": "Nineteen likes because you need strangers arguing on camera to fill the void where your hobbies should be."
    }
  ],
  "shareCardLine": "I liked 239 videos in a week and 151 of them were between midnight and 5 AM."
}

